ed (code still a stub)&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;╍╍ alerts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;No VPC, NAT or servers: Lambda, S3, SQS and Scheduler are pay per use. Owner-only stacks deploy from the owner laptop with CLI credentials; CI deploys CronistaAccountGuards, CronistaWebAcl, CronistaDomain, CronistaEdge and CronistaWorkers." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="1090" width="640" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>